        "unemployment_amt": "",
        "child_support_amt": 500,
        "extended_strength": "",
        "familyFunctioning": "Mr. And Ms. Aarons are recently separated. Ms. Aarons remains in the family home. She is struggling with effectively managing the children''s behaviors. She has difficulty with follow-through on disciplinary actions and will often give-in to minimize their reactions. She reports having strong family supports but they reside out of state so cannot help her with the kids. She has limited social supports outside of her work environment. Mr. Aarons has more supports in place due to his military affiliation, although his parents and most of his long-time friends, also reside out of state. ",
        "parental_strength": "",
        "relation_strength": "",
        "children_insurance": "1",
        "family_description": "Parents are in a high level of conflict due to recent separation and court hearing. Parents are in constant disagreement, which results in minimal decision-making abilities for the children. ",
        "safety_description": "",
        "social_description": "Limited social supports for Ms. Aarons due to her isolation from friends and family, most of whom reside out of state. Mr. Aarons has ample support through his military connections. ",
        "caregiver_insurance": "1",
        "extended_description": "",
        "fcommunication_scale": "3",
        "parental_description": "Parents are not currently effectively collaborating on what is best for the children.",
        "relation_description": "",
        "t_cash_assistance_amt": "",
