        "residential_stability_strength": "",
        "financial_resources_description": "Some financial difficulties present due to looming legal fees and the separation of income. ",
        "residential_stability_description": "There is uncertainty about the ability of Ms. Aarons to remain in the family house. She may have to move or buy Mr. Aarons out. Denisons are pending court results. Mr. Aarons is having difficulty paying for both the home they shared, as well as a new off-base rental he secured. "
